      "source": "# Stage 2 – Anomaly Detection + Full Pipeline Visualization\n\nSupports DENTEX-2023 COCO-format annotations (single train.json), per-image JSON, and YOLO .txt labels.\n\n**Paths:**\n- Stage 1 weights: `/kaggle/input/datasets/ethelrani/maskrcnn-teeth-stage1-weights/`\n- Stage 2 data: `/kaggle/input/datasets/truthisneverlinear/dentex-challenge-2023/`\n\n**Classes (Stage 2):** 0=background, 1=Caries, 2=Deep Caries, 3=Periapical Lesion, 4=Impacted Tooth\n"
